# On case-insensitive filesystems (default macOS APFS), ~/StudyLoop resolves to
# this same repo directory as ~/studyloop. The default dataDir writes project
# data under <dataDir>/projects — never commit runtime study data. F11's
# review.json lands directly under dataDir (not per-project) — same reasoning.
